Template: joustmania/disable_internal_bt
Type: boolean
Default: false
Description: Disable the Raspberry Pi's on-board Bluetooth adapter?
 JoustMania works best with a long-range Class 1 USB Bluetooth dongle for
 PS Move controller pairing. Disabling the on-board adapter forces BlueZ
 to use the dongle.
 .
 Selecting "yes" appends "dtoverlay=disable-bt" to /boot/firmware/config.txt
 and requires a reboot to take effect. You can undo this by editing that
 file manually. Selecting "no" leaves the boot configuration unchanged.
